WEBVTT

00:12.140 --> 00:14.080
Ai!! Ai!!

00:15.610 --> 00:16.550
Ai!!

00:25.790 --> 00:27.420
Ai!!

00:29.460 --> 00:30.900
Where are you?

00:32.730 --> 00:35.700
Where did you go!?

00:36.540 --> 00:39.030
Ai!!

00:52.180 --> 00:56.920
Gokuraku Video! Come out here!
Ai has disappeared!

01:03.830 --> 01:05.230
Come out here!

01:07.800 --> 01:13.000
You promised that I could
use this card as long as I lived!

01:16.680 --> 01:22.440
Come out, Gokuraku!
And give Ai back to me!

01:32.490 --> 01:35.930
Ai! Where did you go!?

01:35.990 --> 01:37.790
If you're not here with me, I--

01:37.860 --> 01:39.460
I--

01:39.530 --> 01:41.260
I--

03:35.910 --> 03:37.010
Ai.

03:38.150 --> 03:39.950
Answer me.

03:40.950 --> 03:43.350
What is your function?

03:44.160 --> 03:46.560
What's that got to do
with anything?

03:46.630 --> 03:50.760
- Send me back to Yota, right now!
- Answer me!

03:55.970 --> 04:00.000
My job is to comfort him.

04:00.070 --> 04:04.840
Correct. And comforting him
is all you should strive for.

04:04.910 --> 04:08.940
A video girl should be
a man's unreachable ideal.

04:09.010 --> 04:11.950
But is that your present path?

04:14.390 --> 04:18.050
Like a human girl,
you act spoiled, lonely...

04:18.120 --> 04:19.720
and jealous.

04:19.790 --> 04:23.160
These emotions have nothing to do
with comforting your man.

04:23.230 --> 04:27.630
You've become unable to fulfill
the functions of a video girl.

04:27.700 --> 04:31.570
Therefore, Ai Amano,
you are being recalled.

04:36.910 --> 04:38.610
See to it.

04:38.680 --> 04:39.740
Yes.

04:44.420 --> 04:47.280
Hey! No! Wait!!

04:56.160 --> 05:00.530
Please. Send me back to Yota
for the time I have left!

05:00.600 --> 05:02.690
It's impossible.
Resign yourself.

05:02.770 --> 05:05.170
But what about Yota!?

05:05.240 --> 05:08.140
He's lonely.
He must be looking for me!

05:08.210 --> 05:10.300
Not anymore.

05:10.380 --> 05:12.810
- You don't know that--
- But I do.

05:12.880 --> 05:16.540
The passage of time here
is accelerated.

05:16.620 --> 05:20.850
Since you're to be recalled,
your tape is fast-forwarding.

05:22.350 --> 05:25.260
A week has gone by
in the real world.

05:25.320 --> 05:28.060
He's given up by now.

05:28.130 --> 05:33.190
Even if you did go back,
your running time is almost finished.

05:33.270 --> 05:34.320
No--

05:34.400 --> 05:37.300
We cannot oppose him.

05:37.370 --> 05:40.030
I'm sorry, but you have to
resign yourself--

05:40.110 --> 05:42.840
Show me what Yota's doing now!

05:42.910 --> 05:46.310
Prove that he's happy
without me!

05:46.380 --> 05:48.240
- Ai--
- Please!

06:05.360 --> 06:07.830
Sorry! Can I ask you something?

06:08.830 --> 06:10.930
Have you seen this girl
anywhere?

06:11.000 --> 06:14.100
Her name is Ai--

06:14.170 --> 06:18.540
I dunno. Try a TV station.

06:29.150 --> 06:30.590
Yota!

06:33.430 --> 06:35.520
Yota! Yota!

06:35.590 --> 06:39.860
<i>Scuse me, but have you seen</i>
<i>this girl--</i>

06:41.870 --> 06:44.930
Yota, I'm right here!
I'm right here!

06:45.000 --> 06:48.100
Yota! Yota!

06:48.170 --> 06:49.900
Yota!

06:50.940 --> 06:53.740
He is!
He is looking for me!

06:53.810 --> 06:56.750
I have to go to him!

06:56.820 --> 06:59.280
If I'm a failure as a video girl,
then make me human!

06:59.350 --> 07:03.120
They call you gods, right?
You can do that much, right!?

07:03.190 --> 07:06.990
Don't hope for the impossible.
You're being recalled.

07:07.060 --> 07:11.020
I'm begging!
See? I'm begging!

07:11.830 --> 07:13.890
I'm begging!

07:22.610 --> 07:24.010
S-She's fading--

07:24.080 --> 07:25.570
Her video--
It's gotta be!

07:42.360 --> 07:43.950
Ai!

07:55.010 --> 07:56.100
Yota.

07:57.540 --> 08:02.540
Ai! Ai, where were you!?
I've been looking for you.

08:02.610 --> 08:04.480
Yota!

08:06.920 --> 08:10.480
I just wanted to talk to you
one last time.

08:10.560 --> 08:11.890
Before I was recalled.

08:11.960 --> 08:17.660
"Recalled"!? D-Don't be ridiculous!
You've got plenty of time!

08:17.730 --> 08:21.360
If a video girl falls in love,
she is recalled.

08:22.300 --> 08:24.390
And I fell in love.

08:29.070 --> 08:32.140
And I love you, Yota!
I love you!

08:33.810 --> 08:36.910
Ai!! Ai!!

08:38.180 --> 08:39.340
Yota!

08:46.660 --> 08:48.290
Ai!

09:00.940 --> 09:03.000
I still need you!

09:05.510 --> 09:07.380
Don't go!

09:38.680 --> 09:42.440
The name is "Ai Amano."
Video girl at large.

09:42.510 --> 09:44.010
Nice to meetcha.

09:46.650 --> 09:49.590
Then, Yota, what do we do now?

09:49.650 --> 09:53.680
We can do anything
you'd like--.

09:55.890 --> 10:03.060
Don't worry. Video girls
aren't able to fall in love.

10:07.840 --> 10:10.870
"Wearing the clothes
Yota gave to Ai..."

10:10.940 --> 10:12.910
"on the occasion
of their first date."

10:19.420 --> 10:24.120
Let's call this
"Good Point" the third.

10:24.190 --> 10:25.490
Ai--

11:00.190 --> 11:03.650
Yota. Yota!
Wake up, Yota!

11:05.360 --> 11:08.160
- Ai!
- Are you okay, Yota?

11:08.230 --> 11:11.970
T-Takashi!

11:19.310 --> 11:21.580
Where am I?

11:21.650 --> 11:26.080
You're in a video
based on your romantic experiences.

11:26.150 --> 11:29.550
You chased a video girl
and wound up here.

11:29.620 --> 11:32.590
"A video girl"?
How would you know?

11:32.660 --> 11:34.750
The video girl.
She told me everything.

11:34.830 --> 11:37.190
So Ai's alive!!

11:37.260 --> 11:39.660
Yeah. But--

11:45.300 --> 11:49.570
I am amazed that a human
entered the video world.

11:50.640 --> 11:53.580
Did she make it happen?

11:53.650 --> 11:56.080
What do you intend to do?

11:56.150 --> 12:01.050
To watch. I want to see
exactly what Ai is.

12:02.390 --> 12:05.980
I had this premonition,
so I went to your house.

12:06.960 --> 12:10.620
I saw you disappear
into the TV screen.

12:10.700 --> 12:11.960
You saw that.

12:12.900 --> 12:16.160
That's when
we were sucked in too.

12:16.230 --> 12:19.900
"We"? Is somebody else here?

12:19.970 --> 12:22.370
Moemi.

12:22.440 --> 12:24.710
We got separated though.

12:25.880 --> 12:29.710
Takashi! You could just abandon
Moemi like that?

12:29.780 --> 12:33.680
I had to. I was more worried
about you.

12:33.750 --> 12:38.120
That's bull!
You're her boyfriend!

12:38.190 --> 12:42.750
If you're not gonna look out for her,
then who will?

12:46.100 --> 12:48.360
You will, Yota.

12:48.430 --> 12:52.370
You'll look after Moemi
from now on.

12:52.440 --> 12:54.840
That's what you want, right?

12:54.910 --> 12:56.970
Takashi!

12:57.040 --> 13:00.030
It's too late!
It's impossible now!

13:00.110 --> 13:02.480
What's so great
about a video girl?

13:04.050 --> 13:07.110
What's so great about Ai
that's making you crazy?

13:07.890 --> 13:10.360
"What's so great"?
It's obvious!

13:10.420 --> 13:13.050
Don't you--
I mean--

13:13.120 --> 13:15.960
- What's so great?
- I'm waiting.

13:16.030 --> 13:19.400
W-Well, for one thing,
she--

13:19.460 --> 13:21.190
She cooks for me.

13:21.270 --> 13:24.400
She listens to my problems
when I'm depressed.

13:24.470 --> 13:26.440
Moemi could do that too.

13:26.500 --> 13:28.910
I-I guess, but--

13:28.970 --> 13:32.410
And Moemi can do it for life.

13:32.480 --> 13:35.880
Takashi, what are you
trying to say!?

13:38.520 --> 13:39.750
Takashi!

13:39.820 --> 13:44.810
Video girls are nothing more
than a dream. Everybody wakes up.

13:54.300 --> 13:55.630
Which is it to be?

13:57.740 --> 14:03.730
Moemi or the video girl.
Which will you search for?

14:03.810 --> 14:07.070
But, until you decide,
you won't find either of them.

14:08.580 --> 14:09.640
Takashi?

14:09.710 --> 14:13.580
T-Takashi!
Takashi!

14:34.170 --> 14:37.300
Oww!
Now where am I?

14:46.750 --> 14:50.590
- What is this place?
- Moteuchi!

14:51.790 --> 14:54.920
M-Moemi!

14:54.990 --> 14:56.020
Moteuchi!

14:57.430 --> 15:00.190
I'm so happy you're here!

15:00.270 --> 15:02.000
I've been looking everywhere
for you!

15:04.600 --> 15:07.160
I was all alone.

15:07.240 --> 15:11.610
And I realized
how much I wanted to see you!

15:11.680 --> 15:14.080
And I searched so long for you--

15:15.750 --> 15:17.580
Moemi! I was searching--

15:20.350 --> 15:22.980
<i>Moemi or the video girl.</i>
<i>Which will you search for?</i>

15:23.050 --> 15:27.050
<i>Until you decide,</i>
<i>you won't find either of them.</i>

15:27.930 --> 15:32.660
<i>I met Moemi first.</i>
<i>Does that mean I love her?</i>

15:32.730 --> 15:37.070
<i>Then what about Ai?</i>
<i>Why did I come here?</i>

15:37.140 --> 15:38.540
Moteuchi?

15:39.340 --> 15:42.070
Could you walk me home?

15:42.140 --> 15:47.840
This is your world, right?
So, if you want to go home, you can!

15:49.850 --> 15:52.210
Maybe, but there's something
I need to do--

15:52.280 --> 15:56.080
But I--
I love you, Moteuchi!

15:56.920 --> 16:01.290
- M-Moemi?
- I love you. I love you, Moteuchi!

16:02.890 --> 16:04.660
I can't!!

16:04.730 --> 16:07.820
But you're dating Takashi!

16:07.900 --> 16:11.960
But the one I love
is here with me!

16:12.040 --> 16:14.060
You feel the same way, right?

16:14.140 --> 16:19.940
When Ai is near, you love her.
And now you love me.

16:22.810 --> 16:26.410
I'm happy you like me...

16:26.480 --> 16:29.110
but that behavior isn't right.

16:34.390 --> 16:37.390
Is love something
you can be sure of?

16:37.460 --> 16:41.370
It's not.
Everything changes with time.

16:41.430 --> 16:44.870
You can look everywhere
for endless love and never find it.

16:44.940 --> 16:46.370
And so...

16:49.910 --> 16:52.930
Stop suffering,
and start having a good time.

17:03.320 --> 17:04.850
Take me, Moteuchi.

17:05.720 --> 17:07.250
Moemi!

17:11.260 --> 17:13.660
S-Stay back!

17:15.070 --> 17:17.060
I said, stay back.

17:17.800 --> 17:20.860
- I'm waiting!
- Stay back! Stay back!

17:22.910 --> 17:26.670
Stay away from me!!

18:04.620 --> 18:07.640
What the hell is this?

18:10.390 --> 18:13.720
Who's doing it?
Who would do this!?

18:45.320 --> 18:48.090
A-Ai!

18:48.160 --> 18:49.350
Ai!

18:52.200 --> 18:53.460
Y-Yota!

18:53.530 --> 18:55.090
Ai!

18:57.030 --> 18:59.560
Yota! You came for me.

19:00.470 --> 19:03.770
Hang on, okay?!
I'm coming for you!

19:13.620 --> 19:16.850
- Ai!
- Yota!

19:19.460 --> 19:20.860
Ai!

19:25.530 --> 19:27.860
What is this!?

19:31.340 --> 19:33.360
Who are you!?

19:33.440 --> 19:35.070
I am Ai Amano's creator.

19:37.280 --> 19:40.010
I see! So then you're the one
who did this to her!

19:43.050 --> 19:46.950
You pretend to be my friends,
just to play with my mind!?

19:48.390 --> 19:52.450
Do you see how fragile
this "love" is?

19:52.520 --> 19:55.930
Stop that! I'll protect Ai!

19:58.860 --> 20:01.260
Ai! Stay right there!

20:11.940 --> 20:14.670
Why is this so painful!?

20:16.350 --> 20:20.440
That staircase represents
your own devotion.

20:20.520 --> 20:21.610
What?

20:21.690 --> 20:26.750
The fragility, the pain,
the impermanence...

20:26.820 --> 20:29.060
is your love.

20:30.530 --> 20:34.560
So what hurts is the pain
of love?

20:55.390 --> 20:59.550
What is the purpose of climbing
that fragile, uncertain stair?

20:59.620 --> 21:02.060
The staircase itself
may vanish.

21:02.490 --> 21:05.190
There's no proof Ai is up there.

21:05.260 --> 21:10.530
Can you prove that your love
is more than mere illusion?

21:17.240 --> 21:18.370
Yota!

21:20.950 --> 21:22.440
Look at yourself.

21:23.950 --> 21:30.180
Drowning in the wounds
caused by this "love" of yours!

22:10.760 --> 22:13.490
Now, just let go.

22:13.560 --> 22:17.730
If you do, you'll be saved
from the suffering!

22:17.800 --> 22:20.000
And you'll go back
to your world.

22:20.070 --> 22:23.870
Never! Never!

22:24.980 --> 22:28.610
My love is--
Love is--

22:51.540 --> 22:53.660
Yota.

22:53.740 --> 22:54.830
Yota!

22:55.940 --> 22:58.670
- Ai!
- Yota!

22:59.640 --> 23:02.110
I finally made it.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.610
Yota!

23:12.560 --> 23:14.420
Yota!

23:21.900 --> 23:23.830
This makes no sense.

23:23.900 --> 23:26.870
All for a video girl
you are fated to lose.

23:26.940 --> 23:28.300
You waste your love on her.

23:29.670 --> 23:33.270
What can I say?
I fell in love.

23:37.880 --> 23:39.750
No! You can't!

24:01.440 --> 24:03.340
Ai--
Are you--?

24:03.410 --> 24:04.840
Yota!

24:06.240 --> 24:08.270
I'm here for you!

24:13.350 --> 24:14.280
Yota.

24:15.520 --> 24:16.610
Yota!

24:17.590 --> 24:19.110
Yota!

24:21.360 --> 24:23.880
Yota!!

24:25.460 --> 24:28.460
A-Ai!

24:28.530 --> 24:31.130
I-I'm sorry!
Forgive me!

24:31.200 --> 24:34.470
And forget about me!
Go away!

24:36.440 --> 24:39.040
Don't worry!

24:39.110 --> 24:42.640
If I disappear,
I won't regret any of it!

24:42.710 --> 24:45.110
It was just for a moment...

24:45.180 --> 24:48.620
but I know what it means
to love!

24:48.690 --> 24:52.090
You know...what it means?

25:35.870 --> 25:41.270
<i>It's true. There is nothing</i>
<i>in the world that is certain.</i>

25:42.110 --> 25:45.300
<i>But, if it is even for a minute--</i>

25:45.380 --> 25:46.710
<i>Even for a fleeting moment...</i>

25:46.780 --> 25:49.680
I know that I love Ai.

25:52.720 --> 25:54.310
Yota!

25:55.550 --> 25:59.650
Go away!
All of it! Vanish!!

26:16.640 --> 26:20.630
<i>It was only for a moment,</i>
<i>but I felt it!</i>

26:20.710 --> 26:26.080
<i>Let it just be Ai and me.</i>
<i>And the world can just vanish.</i>

26:27.650 --> 26:32.090
<i>But it was only for a moment.</i>

26:32.160 --> 26:35.790
<i>In the next moment,</i>
<i>it all went back to normal.</i>
